 "arrive_text": "Inside the wall the plateau is wide and nearly flat, and the wind comes across it from the mountains with nothing to stop it. Houses stand in their fenced plots along graveled lanes, with granaries up on posts beside them. In the middle, bigger than any other building, is the hall where the elders sat until a few days ago. They don't sit there now.",
